26-10-16/li/outputs/ReNewMarket.html#Collectibles">Collectibles</a></p></section><section class="panel" id="Electronics"><h2>Electronics</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="photo">🎧</div><h3>Wireless Headphones</h3><span class="tag">Electronics</span><span class="tag">Good</span><p>Comfortable over-ear headphones, tested and working.</p><p class="muted">Seller: Local Seller · Available</p><p><b>₹1800</b></p><button class="btn" data-act="buy" data-id="1">Contact / Order</button><button class="btn gray" data-act="fav" data-id="1">♡ Favorite</button></article></div></section><section class="panel" id="Furniture"><h2>Furniture</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="photo">🪑</div><h3>Solid Wood Side Table</h3><span class="tag">Furniture</span><span class="tag">Very good</span><p>Sturdy bedside table with a small drawer.</p><p class="muted">Seller: Local Seller · Available</p><p><b>₹2400</b></p><button class="btn" data-act="buy" data-id="2">Contact / Order</button><button class="btn gray" data-act="fav" data-id="2">♡ Favorite</button></article></div></section><section class="panel" id="Clothing"><h2>Clothing</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="photo">🧥</div><h3>Denim Jacket</h3><span class="tag">Clothing</span><span class="tag">Good</span><p>Classic blue denim jacket, size M.</p><p class="muted">Seller: Local Seller · Available</p><p><b>₹850</b></p><button class="btn" data-act="buy" data-id="3">Contact / Order</button><button class="btn gray" data-act="fav" data-id="3">♡ Favorite</button></article></div></section><section class="panel" id="Collectibles"><h2>Collectibles</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="photo">📷</div><h3>Vintage Camera</h3><span class="tag">Collectibles</span><span class="tag">Fair</span><p>Vintage film camera sold as a collectible.</p><p class="muted">Seller: Local Seller · Available</p><p><b>₹3200</b></p><button class="btn" data-act="buy" data-id="4">Contact / Order</button><